        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3-4 BEDROOM TRADITIONAL OLD STYLE FARMHOUSE RESIDENCE ON C.14.11 ACRES, WITH DETACHED OUTHOUSES AND AN OPEN HAYSHED.\r\n\r\nDavis Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this traditional Old-style farmhouse on c.14.11 acres, comprising of both grassland and forestry, in the heart of north Longford.\r\n\r\nThis property comprises of a three-bedroom detached old style farmhouse on c.5.71 hectares, together with detached outhouses and an open hayshed. Located just three miles from the village of Aughnacliffe, the c.85m2 accommodation consists of three bedrooms, a living room, kitchen, sitting room and a WC Shower room. The property is in need of repair and renovation works throughout.\r\n\r\nThe lands are of average quality, with approximately 2.20 hectares planted with a mixture of ash, sitka spruce and larch, while the remaining lands are under grass. The plantation has been affected by both ash dieback and storm damage. The fabulous lake districts of Mullinalaghta, Gowna as well as Aughnacliffe are all within a ten-minute drive away. \r\n\r\nPlease contact us on 043-33 50555 for further details\r\n\r\nEircode: N39 Y2R1\r\nContained in Folio: LD3454\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grant available\r\n\r\nSEAI Energy Grants available \r\n\r\nOffice or 4th Bedroom option easy to convert on ground floor\r\n\r\nBallinalee, Aughnacliffe, Arvagh and Granard just a few minutes’ drive\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating\r\n\r\nSolid fuel range in the living room with backboiler\r\n\r\nBroadband available (National)\r\n\r\nPvc windows and doors\r\n\r\nBus service to Secondary Schools in Granard and Moyne CS\r\n\r\nCavan and Longford within a 30 minute drive\r\n\r\nLongford Train Station: 25 Minute drive\r\n\r\n7 Trains a day on the Dublin-Sligo Line\r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 20 mins\r\n\r\nSeptic Tank\r\n\r\nMains Water\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION:\r\nEntrance hall:\r\nSitting room/bedroom: 3.70m x 3.50m\r\nLiving room:  3.70m x 3.00m\r\nKitchen: 1.90m x 2.25m\r\nBathroom: 1.45m x 2.45m\r\nBed 1: 4.05m x 3.00m\r\nBed 2: 3.25m x 1.95m\r\nBed 3: 2.25m x 4.15m\r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nReceipt of these particulars implies an obligation to conduct all negotiations through Padraic Davis Auctioneers LTD. The contents do not constitute an offer or form the basis of any contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition etc, are given in good faith and are believed to be correct. Any intending purchasers should not rely on them and are strongly advised to view the property for themselves. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided are for guidance purposes only. These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer; they do not form any part of the resulting contract. The boundary markings for this land holding, outlined in Red, are strictly for guidance purposes only."
